{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-132-1","title":"Psalms 132:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David in his prayer commends unto God the religious care he had for the ark. 8 His prayer at the removing of the ark; 11 with a repetition of God's promises.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2962. B.C. 1042. (Title.) A Song of degrees.Some attribute this Psalm to Solomon; and others refer it to the building of the second temple; but it seems more probable that it was sung at the solemn induction of the ark into the tabernacle of Mount Zion, expressing the holy joy and triumph of that event.</p>\n<p>120:1; 121:1; 122:1; 123:1; 124:1; 125:1; 126:1; 127:1; 128:1; *titles 129:1; 130:1; 131:1; *titles remember. 25:6,7; Ge 8:1; Ex 2:24; La 3:19; 5:1 all his afflictions. 1Sa 18:1-30:31; 2Sa 15:1-20:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-2","title":"Psalms 132:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>he sware. 56:12; 65:1; 66:13,14; 116:14-18; 119:106; 2Sa 7:1 the mighty. 5; 46:11; 50:1; 146:5,6; Ge 49:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-3","title":"Psalms 132:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I will not. Ec 9:10; Hag 1:4; Mt 6:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-4","title":"Psalms 132:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>give sleep. Ge 24:33; Ru 3:18; Pr 6:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-5","title":"Psalms 132:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I find. 2Sa 6:17; 1Ch 15:3,12; Ac 7:46 an habitation. Heb. habitations. 1Ki 8:27; 2Ch 2:6; Isa 66:1; Ac 7:47-49; Eph 2:22 for the mighty. 2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-6","title":"Psalms 132:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>at Ephratah. Ru 1:2; 1Sa 17:12; Mic 5:2 we found. 1Sa 7:1; 1Ch 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-7","title":"Psalms 132:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>will go. 5:7; 66:13,14; 118:19; 122:1; Isa 2:3 worship. 95:6; 99:5,9; La 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-8","title":"Psalms 132:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Arise. 68:1; Nu 10:35,36; 2Ch 6:41,42 the ark. 78:61</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-9","title":"Psalms 132:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>thy priests. 16; 93:1; 104:1; Job 29:14; Isa 61:10; Ro 13:14; 1Pe 5:5; Re 19:8 let thy saints. 35:26,27; 68:3; 70:4; Jud 5:31 shout. 47:1; Isa 65:14; Ezr 3:11,12; Zep 3:14; Zec 9:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-10","title":"Psalms 132:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thy servant. 1Ki 11:12,13,34; 15:4,5; 2Ki 19:34; Ho 3:5 turn not. 84:9; 89:38,39; 2Ch 6:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-11","title":"Psalms 132:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>sworn. 89:3,4,33,37; 110:4; 1Sa 15:29; Jer 33:20-26; Heb 6:18 Of the fruit. 2Sa 7:12; 1Ki 8:25; 2Ch 6:16; Lu 1:69,70; Ac 2:30 body. Heb. belly.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-12","title":"Psalms 132:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>If thy children. 89:30-35 their children. 102:28; 115:14; Isa 9:7; 59:21; Lu 1:32,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-13","title":"Psalms 132:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the Lord. 76:1,2; 78:68,69; Isa 14:32; Heb 12:22 he hath desired. 48:1-3; 68:16; 87:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-14","title":"Psalms 132:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>my rest. 8; Isa 11:10; 66:1; Zep 3:17 here will. 68:18; 76:2; 135:21; 1Ki 8:13,27; Isa 8:18; 12:6; 57:15; Joe 3:21 Eph 2:22; Heb 12:22; Re 21:23 for I have. 87:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-15","title":"Psalms 132:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>abundantly. or, surely. bless her provision. 147:14; Ex 23:25; Le 26:4,5; De 28:2-5; Pr 3:9,10; Hag 1:6,9 Hag 2:16-19; Mal 2:2; Mt 14:19-21; Lu 1:53; 2Co 9:10,11 I will satisfy. 22:26; 33:18,19; 36:8; 37:3,19; De 14:29; Isa 33:16; Jer 31:14 Mt 5:6; 6:32,33; Mr 8:6-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-16","title":"Psalms 132:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>clothe. 9; 140:4; 2Ch 6:41; Isa 61:10; Ga 3:27 her saints. Ho 11:12; Zec 9:9,15-17; Joh 16:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-17","title":"Psalms 132:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>will I make. 92:10; 148:14; Eze 29:21; Lu 1:69 I have ordained. 1Ki 11:36; 15:4; 2Ch 21:7; Lu 2:30-32 lamp. or, candle.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-132-18","title":"Psalms 132:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":132,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":132,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>His enemies. 21:8,9; 35:26; 109:29; Job 8:22; Da 12:2 but upon. 72:8-11; Isa 9:6,7; 58:10-12; Mt 28:18; Lu 1:32,33; Re 11:15 Re 17:14</p>"}]}